{"id":"escritorio","lemma":"escritorio","pos":"noun","rank":1662,"glosses":["writing desk","study (room where writing is done)","desktop, desktop computer (the main graphical user interface of an operating system)"],"ipa":"/eskɾiˈtoɾjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"escritorios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-escritorio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi escritorio es viejo.","en":"My desk is old.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440959"},{"text":"Estos son nuestros escritorios.","en":"These are our desks."},{"text":"Él está en su escritorio.","en":"He is at his desk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444366"},{"text":"Este escritorio es el mío.","en":"This desk is mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38447"},{"text":"¿Qué hay sobre el escritorio?","en":"What is on the desk?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453115"}]}